Items
-----
The repository does not contain the items of the benchmark, except the sample items in tests/samples/, which are generated core items
(no third-party text). The generated core items are released under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), as on the Hugging Face dataset card
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/startlux-models/DecisionPivot). DecisionPivot is for evaluation only: its items must not be used as training data or put
into the prompts of a model that is being trained.

Reference track
---------------
The 35 reference tasks are not ours: they are public test sets created by other authors, who keep their copyright, converted to the
item format. Every converted item follows the licence of its source, which the task card of
the task names (field "licence" in releases/*/task_cards/<task>.json), together with the source, its address and the version used. The
scripts in reference/build/ download the source files of 13 tasks from their official locations and convert them; the terms of those
sources apply to the files they download and to the items they write. This repository contains none of these source files.

